@host = http://localhost:5251

### ==================== ECHO ====================

### Echo any verb, any sub-path — returns method, url, query, headers, cookies, body, parsed JSON, client info
POST {{host}}/api/echo/anything/you/like?tag=a&tag=b&page=1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Custom-Header: hello

{ "name": "APIBee", "tags": ["test", "echo"] }

### Echo a form post (fields + raw body)
PUT {{host}}/api/echo
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Ada&role=engineer

### Echo multipart (fields + file metadata)
POST {{host}}/api/echo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----APIBee

------APIBee
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Quarterly report
------APIBee
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

hello from a file
------APIBee--

### Request headers only
GET {{host}}/api/echo/headers
Authorization: Bearer demo-token

### Client IP (honours X-Forwarded-For / X-Real-IP for display)
GET {{host}}/api/echo/ip
X-Forwarded-For: 203.0.113.7

### User agent
GET {{host}}/api/echo/user-agent

### HEAD — headers only, no body
HEAD {{host}}/api/echo


### ==================== METHODS ====================

GET {{host}}/api/methods/get

###
POST {{host}}/api/methods/post
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hello": "world" }

###
PUT {{host}}/api/methods/put
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 1, "name": "replaced" }

###
PATCH {{host}}/api/methods/patch
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "patched" }

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/methods/delete

###
HEAD {{host}}/api/methods/head

###
OPTIONS {{host}}/api/methods/options

### Wrong verb -> 405 Method Not Allowed with Allow: GET
POST {{host}}/api/methods/get

### Any verb accepted
PATCH {{host}}/api/methods/any
Content-Type: text/plain

any body at all


### ==================== STATUS CODES ====================

### Any code 200-599 (any verb)
GET {{host}}/api/status/418

### 204 — no body
DELETE {{host}}/api/status/204

### 3xx — Location: /api/echo
GET {{host}}/api/status/301

### 401 — WWW-Authenticate header
GET {{host}}/api/status/401

### 429 / 503 — Retry-After header
GET {{host}}/api/status/429

### Weighted random: 200 three times as likely as 500
GET {{host}}/api/status/random?codes=200:3,500:1

### All known status codes
GET {{host}}/api/status/list


### ==================== REDIRECTS ====================

### 5-hop chain ending at /api/echo
GET {{host}}/api/redirect/5

### Chain using absolute Location URLs
GET {{host}}/api/redirect/absolute/3

### Chain using relative Location references ("2", "../../echo")
GET {{host}}/api/redirect/relative/3

### 303 See Other — client should follow with GET and drop the body
POST {{host}}/api/redirect/status/303
Content-Type: application/json

{ "order": 42 }

### 307 Temporary Redirect — client must repeat POST with the same body
POST {{host}}/api/redirect/status/307
Content-Type: application/json

{ "order": 42 }

### 308 Permanent Redirect — method and body preserved
PUT {{host}}/api/redirect/status/308
Content-Type: application/json

{ "order": 42 }

### Redirect to a local path (absolute URLs rejected — no open redirect)
GET {{host}}/api/redirect/to?url=/api/status/200&status=302

### Rejected: absolute URL -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/redirect/to?url=https://example.com

### Infinite loop — tests the client's max-redirect limit
GET {{host}}/api/redirect/loop


### ==================== COOKIES ====================

### Set several cookies
GET {{host}}/api/cookies/set?theme=dark&lang=en

### Set one cookie with attributes
GET {{host}}/api/cookies/set/token/abc123?httpOnly=true&secure=true&sameSite=strict&maxAge=3600&path=/

### List cookies the client sent
GET {{host}}/api/cookies

### Delete specific cookies (omit names to delete all)
DELETE {{host}}/api/cookies/delete?names=theme,lang

### Session login (test / test123 or admin / admin123) -> apibee_session cookie
POST {{host}}/api/cookies/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "test", "password": "test123" }

### Current user from the session cookie (401 without it)
GET {{host}}/api/cookies/me

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/cookies/logout


### ==================== CACHING ====================

### ETag — note the ETag response header
GET {{host}}/api/cache/etag

### If-None-Match -> 304 Not Modified
GET {{host}}/api/cache/etag
If-None-Match: "doc-v1"

### Conditional update without If-Match -> 428 Precondition Required
PUT {{host}}/api/cache/etag
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Updated title" }

### Conditional update with a stale ETag -> 412 Precondition Failed
PUT {{host}}/api/cache/etag
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "doc-v99"

{ "title": "Updated title" }

### Conditional update with the current ETag -> 200, new ETag
PUT {{host}}/api/cache/etag
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "doc-v1"

{ "title": "Updated title", "content": "New content" }

### Reset the document to version 1
POST {{host}}/api/cache/etag/reset

### Last-Modified / If-Modified-Since -> 304
GET {{host}}/api/cache/last-modified
If-Modified-Since: Wed, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 GMT

### Cache-Control: public, max-age=120
GET {{host}}/api/cache/max-age/120

### Never cache
GET {{host}}/api/cache/no-store

### Vary: Accept-Language (en, es, fr, de, hi)
GET {{host}}/api/cache/vary
Accept-Language: fr-FR, es;q=0.8


### ==================== REQUEST BODIES ====================

### JSON only (other Content-Types -> 415)
POST {{host}}/api/bodies/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 7, "items": [1, 2, 3], "active": true }

### Wrong Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{host}}/api/bodies/json
Content-Type: text/plain

{ "id": 7 }

### URL-encoded form
POST {{host}}/api/bodies/form
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

color=red&color=blue&size=M

### Plain text — character, line and word counts
POST {{host}}/api/bodies/text
Content-Type: text/plain

The quick brown fox
jumps over the lazy dog

### XML — parsed into an element tree (DTDs rejected)
POST {{host}}/api/bodies/xml
Content-Type: application/xml

<order id="1001">
  <customer>Ada Lovelace</customer>
  <item sku="BK-1" qty="2">Notebook</item>
  <item sku="PN-4" qty="5">Pen</item>
</order>

### Binary — size, sha256, md5, first 16 bytes
POST {{host}}/api/bodies/binary
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./fundamentals.http

### Any body — content sniffing vs declared Content-Type
PUT {{host}}/api/bodies/any
Content-Type: text/plain

{ "actually": "json" }

### Large upload (streamed, up to 10MB; larger -> 413)
POST {{host}}/api/bodies/large
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./fundamentals.http
